 "open": [
  "claude-sync holds 16 files (store, journal, orchestrator exports, THREADS, shared RULES, STATUS, some plan data). In every case I checked, the repo copy is a superset of the hub's (store rev 16 vs 14; the hub RULES is just older). Picking a side is Brett's call (`claude-sync resolve <id> --keep local|hub`); the banner already has `blocked:claude-sync-held`.",
  "UI Review `r-20261101-f74d2ada` is waiting for Brett.",
  "Item 9 has no orchestrator build: the rules want one, and the build profile is Brett's pick. A headless run can't ask, so it's tracked in the change log entry and THREADS instead.",
